      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is a temporary fix for b/227455445, until we can flesh out all usages of weak references and add annotations on those fields with the annotation introduced in:\nhttps://android-review.googlesource.com/c/platform/frameworks/libs/modules-utils/+/2094725\nThis will disable a very small optimization in R8 that has never been utilized in AOSP by any app (since it was only live for a short time before we reverted it)",
